    "notes": "The sole loss receipt empties six Themis market reserves. Gross depletion is 44,758.273451813505008435 DAI, 85,753.783607 USDC, 58,824.329320 USDT, 85,149.641487792003679412 ARB, 1.08947859 WBTC, and 97.620373410593518825 WETH. The WETH market transfers 317.620373410593518825 WETH out after receiving 220 WETH of same-receipt borrower collateral, so only the exact net reserve depletion is counted. Each reserve's archive balance falls by the declared net amount and ends at zero. LP and gauge tokens are borrower-supplied collateral, not additional victim depletion; flash liquidity and later conversions dispose of or finance already-counted assets and are excluded. The seed's approximately $370,000 proceeds estimate is replaced by exact reserve depletion. Exact decimal component arithmetic totals $512,004.35786888399426448664; the JSON number is its nearest IEEE-754 representation.",
