      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-30T18:55:00Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the successful loss receipt and trace, every reserve transfer, archive balances at blocks 105,524,523 and 105,524,524, sender and helper transaction histories, proxy and implementation creation receipts, factory activation logs, historical EIP-1967 storage and runtimes, and independently preceding DefiLlama prices. The DAI, USDC, USDT, ARB, WBTC and WETH reserve balances fall from the declared amounts to zero. The WETH reserve starts with 97.620373410593518825 WETH, receives exactly 220 WETH from the helper, and transfers exactly 317.620373410593518825 WETH to the campaign, reconciling to zero. No other transaction in the block touches the reserve set. Sender nonce 0 creates helper 0x05a1b877330c168451f081bfaf32d690ea964fca 332 seconds before nonce 1 performs the sole loss; the anchor creates helper 0x33f3fb58ea0f91f4bd8612d9f477420b01023f25 internally. Sender nonces 2 through 6 only approve, swap, or bridge borrowed assets and do not touch a Themis reserve. Factory 0x88862b6e683c1aba1081ac548bf7b037c52aee2c creates proxy 0x75f805e2fb248462e7817f0230b36e9fae0280fc in source-3 at block 101,340,897 index 4, timestamp 1,686,813,241. The factory's log 9 names the new proxy in topic 2 and implementation 0x848f29fe9e3f0ba67095c26ebe48648ccfd8148d in topic 3. The proxy is absent one block earlier; its 1,957-byte runtime and EIP-1967 implementation slot are unchanged from creation through the pre-incident block. The 20,611-byte implementation runtime hashes to 0x98b8ab37048c661364dd8e20ce883c493f106995f74cf3fe6cc6bd9ad8e11be at its source-4 deployment, proxy activation and pre-incident state, and the loss trace delegates the implicated calls to it. ETH, BTC and ARB price observations precede the incident by 22, 16 and 21 seconds."
